On 2007-02-02, ilya2@rcn.com wrote:
> While polymorphed into a dragon, my wizard laid an egg. Later she went
> to another level without the baby dragon, and now the baby is
> "peaceful". I have no charm monster spell or scroll. Is there any way
> to make him "tame" again?

Other than taming magic, no. Once your dragon turned from tame to
peaceful, the game no longer cares wether it once was your pet or
even wether it is your own offspring or not, it's just a peaceful
baby dragon.  Since a dragon is not a domestic animal, it cannot be
tamed with food, either, so you're left with the spell or scroll or
alternatively a magic harp.

Consult http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/pets2.html for
information on how to keep a pet.

